---
AI capex announcement: $15B for 2026 — well above consensus of $10B.

```thought
This changes the FCF picture significantly. $15B capex vs prior $8B means
~$7B incremental spend. FCF drops from ~$95B to ~$88B in my model.

At $88B FCF, fair value drops to ~$225. But if AI capex drives revenue
acceleration (say 9% CAGR instead of 7%), we're back to $260.

Key variable: revenue elasticity relative to capex. Need to track.
```

**TODO:** Update DCF model for new capex figures. Sensitivity analysis needed.

