---
TSMC investor day notes:
- 3nm yields now above plan (85% vs expected 80%)
- CoWoS capacity doubling for 2026
- Apple is still the lead customer, but NVIDIA demand is accelerating

NVIDIA announced Blackwell Ultra at GTC. AMD MI350 specs leaked — 2.4 TB/s memory bandwidth.

```thought
Apple's custom silicon strategy makes sense in the context of the AI capex
announcement. If they can match NVDA inference performance at lower TCO,
the data center expansion could actually drive meaningful Services margin
improvement. This is underappreciated by the market.
```

**Action Item:** Review AMD MI350 benchmarks when officially released. Compare inference perf/W against Apple's M4 Ultra for data center workloads.
